{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00185","headline":"中和节日宴百僚赐诗 · 德宗皇帝","name":"中和节日宴百僚赐诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"韶年啓仲序，初吉谐良辰。\n肇兹中和节，式庆天地春。\n欢酣朝野同，生德区宇均。\n云开洒膏露，草疏芳河津。\n岁华今载阳，东作方肆勤。\n慙非熏风唱，曷用慰吾人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"德宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00185.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00185","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}